 Main features:

1 Suite with private bathroom;

2 Large bedrooms with excellent natural light;

1 Office, perfect for teleworking or additional room;

Spacious living and dining room, ideal for moments with family and friends;

Modern and fully equipped kitchen;

Independent, functional and organised laundry;

Landscaped outdoor area, with prepared space and possibility for the construction of a swimming pool;

Large garage, with capacity for several vehicles;

